<title>USA: FSA qualifies two muni issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies two muni issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said on Monday that it qualified two municipal bond issues, which will be sold competitively, for insurance.</p>
<p>--North Central CSD, Iowa, $3.7 million school general obligations.</p>
<p>--Mesick, Mich., $7.105 million school building bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
